{"seq":8,"slug":"molecular-gastronomy","title":"分子料理","stage":"DONE","category":"cooking-food-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy","rating":{"composite":3.88,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"分子料理\">分子料理</h1><p>分子料理（Molecular Gastronomy）是一门将物理化学原理应用于烹饪实践的交叉学科。它既不是一种菜系，也不是一种烹饪风格，而是一套理解食物在加热、混合、冷却过程中发生何种变化的科学方法论。法国物理化学家埃尔韦·蒂斯（Hervé This）与匈牙利物理学家尼古拉斯·库尔蒂（Nicholas Kurti）于 1988 年正式提出&quot;分子与物理美食学&quot;这一术语，标志着该领域的诞生。三十余年来，分子料理从实验室走进米其林餐厅，又逐步渗透到家庭厨房，深刻改变了人们对&quot;烹饪&quot;的理解。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦分子料理的科学原理、核心技术、风味质地与工具实践四条主线，按由理入术的顺序编排。第一章&quot;基础科学&quot;讲胶体、相变与历史脉络，是理解后续技术的前提；第二章&quot;核心技术&quot;深入球化、乳化泡沫、低温慢煮三大标志性技法；第三章&quot;风味与质地&quot;从感知层面探讨风味释放、质地改造和感官错觉；第四章&quot;工具与实践&quot;落地到设备、原料和家庭厨房应用。建议首次阅读者按章节顺序通读，有经验者可直接跳至感兴趣的技术文档。</p>\n<p>兄弟 hub 分工：本 hub 专注分子料理的科学原理与现代技法（球化、低温慢煮、泡沫等），不涉及传统烹饪技法的全面讲解。烹饪化学的基础反应（美拉德、焦糖化等）在本 hub 有深度展开，但 broader 的食物化学体系可参考同分类下的其他 hub。食材本身的营养与化学属于食品化学范畴，不在本 hub 讨论范围内。</p>\n<p>前置知识：高中化学（胶体、溶液、化学键概念）和基础物理（热传递、相变）足以理解本 hub 全部内容。不要求读者具备专业化学背景，但对&quot;为什么&quot;有好奇心会显著提升阅读体验。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"science-foundations","title":"基础科学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/science-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"history-development","title":"分子料理发展史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/science-foundations/history-development"},{"seq":2,"slug":"food-colloids","title":"食品胶体科学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/science-foundations/food-colloids"},{"seq":3,"slug":"temperature-phase-change","title":"温度与相变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/science-foundations/temperature-phase-change"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-techniques","title":"核心技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/core-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spherification","title":"球化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/core-techniques/spherification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"emulsification-foam","title":"乳化与泡沫","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/core-techniques/emulsification-foam"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sous-vide","title":"低温慢煮与真空烹饪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/core-techniques/sous-vide"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"flavor-texture","title":"风味与质地","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/flavor-texture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"flavor-release","title":"风味释放机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/flavor-texture/flavor-release"},{"seq":2,"slug":"texture-modification","title":"质地改造","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/flavor-texture/texture-modification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sensory-illusion","title":"感官欺骗与错觉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/flavor-texture/sensory-illusion"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"tools-practice","title":"工具与实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/tools-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"equipment","title":"分子料理工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/tools-practice/equipment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ingredients-additives","title":"关键原料与添加剂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/tools-practice/ingredients-additives"},{"seq":3,"slug":"home-kitchen-apps","title":"家庭厨房应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/tools-practice/home-kitchen-apps"}]}]}